OL,3,GNEWSABaby injured after masked group
OL,4,Athrow bricks at bus
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage boy has been arrested after a
OL,7,Fnine-month-old baby was injured when a
OL,8,Fbrick was thrown at a bus in Liverpool.
OL,10,FIt happened near Alder Hey Children's
OL,11,FHospital at about 22:10 GMT on Friday.
OL,13,FPolice were called to reports that a
OL,14,Fgroup of males dressed in black and
OL,15,Fwearing balaclavas had dragged a large
OL,16,Fpiece of wood onto East Prescot Road,
OL,17,Fforcing the bus to stop.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
