OL,3,GNEWSABaby injured after masked group
OL,4,Athrow bricks at bus
OL,5,
OL,6,FMerseyside Police said the group then
OL,7,Fthrew bricks at the vehicle and smashed
OL,8,Fa window, causing cuts to the face and
OL,9,Fhead of the baby boy, who was taken to
OL,10,Fhospital as a precaution.
